dex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `dex fork`, `dex exec`, and `dex exec fork`
dex fork --worktree: `dex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
dex fork --worktree --last: `dex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
dex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `dex exec fork --worktree`
dex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
dex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `dex fork`, `dex exec`, and `dex exec fork`
dex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `dex fork`, `dex exec`, and `dex exec fork`
dex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `dex fork`, `dex exec`, and `dex exec fork`
